Rectangle

The container's seccomp profile is adapted from Playwright v1.56.1.
See server/PLAYWRIGHT-LICENSE for the Apache License 2.0 and upstream
attributions. Rectangle's changes include allowing chroot for Firefox's
own user namespace sandbox.

Firefox, Alpine Linux, TigerVNC, uBlock Origin, Freebuff and other
third-party dependencies retain their own licenses. The source repository
contains image build recipes; it does not bundle their binaries.
